next-env.d.ts

# `.env` is committed, with every key blank: a fresh clone then starts with the
# right shape and no setup, and `/setup` fills the keys in on the machine.
#
# It is tracked, so it stays tracked — that is the point of shipping it. The
# cost is real: `/setup` writing a key leaves `.env` dirty, and a careless
# `git add -A` would commit that key. Before committing anything, check
# `git diff .env` and do not stage it if it now holds a key.
#
# `.env.local` is still ignored — it is machine-local overrides, never shipped.
.env.local

# `.env` sống tới khi bạn tự xoá — `uninstall.bat` giữ nguyên nó.

# Generated lesson library index + cached narration rebuild themselves.
data/library-text/
data/tts-cache/

# Giọng nói tải về cho giọng đọc chạy trên máy (Piper). Mỗi voice là một file
# .onnx 60 MB, tải lại được bằng nút "cài giọng" ở /setup, nên để trong repo chỉ
# làm nặng lịch sử git.
/data/voices/

